  The complete original license, including historical NCSA terms, is retained
  unchanged in LICENSE_UPSTREAM.TXT. Original per-file notices are retained.

LLVM Go bindings / go-llvm
  tango/overlay/src/cmd/internal/llvm contains historical LLVM Go bindings
  with extensions maintained at https://github.com/tinygo-org/go-llvm.
  The directory's NOTICE lists the eight derived files and its LICENSE.txt
  contains the original LLVM license, including historical terms.
  These files and their modifications retain Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.
  The files are copied into Tango without changing their license.
  C API implementations and declarations are also adapted from go-llvm
  IRBindings.cpp, IRBindings.h, backports.cpp and backports.h in
  llvm/lib/TangoLLVM/TangoLLVM.cpp and llvm/include/llvm-c/TangoLLVM.h.
  These binding portions and their modifications retain
  Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; the complete original license is in
  tango/overlay/src/cmd/internal/llvm/LICENSE.txt.

